.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-onboard - Interactive onboarding wizard with resume, claims, and stack provisioning


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit onboard [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Interactive onboarding wizard that sets up developer identity, SSH keys,
repository clones, Cursor MCP integrations, and local development infrastructure.

.PP
Pro capabilities:
  --resume                          Resume an interrupted onboarding session
  --ignore-and-remove-checkpoint    Discard saved incomplete session checkpoint and start fresh
  --rollback                        Revert cloned repositories and provisioned credentials
  --diag-bundle                     Generate a sanitized diagnostic bundle for troubleshooting
  --auto-fix                        Automatically remediate missing prerequisites and toolchains
  --dry-run                         Run pre-flight diagnostics and preview onboarding actions


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-f\fP, \fB--auto-fix\fP[=false]
	Automatically install missing prerequisites and toolchain dependencies

.PP
\fB--diag-bundle\fP[=""]
	Generate a sanitized diagnostic tar.gz bundle (optional filename)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Run pre-flight check and preview onboarding actions without making changes

.PP
\fB--edge-url\fP=""
	Onboarding edge gateway URL (default: $ORBIT_SERVER or http://localhost:8080)

.PP
\fB--email\fP=""
	Developer email address

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for onboard

.PP
\fB--ignore-and-remove-checkpoint\fP[=false]
	Discard saved incomplete session checkpoint and start fresh

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output JSON progress event stream

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml manifest

.PP
\fB-n\fP, \fB--name\fP=""
	Developer display name

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in non-interactive mode without prompting

.PP
\fB--resume\fP[=false]
	Resume interrupted onboarding session from saved checkpoint

.PP
\fB--rollback\fP[=false]
	Rollback provisioned resources and clear session

.PP
\fB-s\fP, \fB--server\fP=""
	Orbit server URL (alias for --edge-url)

.PP
\fB--session-file\fP=""
	Custom path to session persistence file

.PP
\fB--skip-stack\fP[=false]
	Skip local dev stack initialization

.PP
\fB--ssh-dir\fP=""
	Custom SSH directory path (default: ~/.ssh)

.PP
\fB--start-stack\fP[=false]
	Automatically start local dev stack without prompting

.PP
\fB-t\fP, \fB--token\fP=""
	Cryptographically signed onboarding invite token

.PP
\fB-u\fP, \fB--uid\fP=""
	Desired username / UID

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	Target workspace root directory

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip interactive confirmation prompts and automatically proceed


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit(1)\fP
